  <!-- ── SECTION 12: FAQ ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="section__inner">

      <div class="faq-header reveal">
        <h2 class="section__h2">Common questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list" x-data="{ open: null }">

        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="1" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 0 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 0 ? null : 0" :aria-expanded="open === 0">
            How long does setup take?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 0" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Most businesses are fully live within one day. We handle the initial configuration — your service catalog, staff roster, branch setup, and pricing. You just review and go.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="2" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 1 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 1 ? null : 1" :aria-expanded="open === 1">
            Can I use Zenly for multiple branches?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 1" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Yes. Zenly is built multi-branch from the ground up. Each branch has its own staff, rooms, pricing, and daily close — but you can view and compare all branches from a single admin dashboard.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="3" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 2 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 2 ? null : 2" :aria-expanded="open === 2">
            Does Zenly work for businesses other than spas?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 2" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>Absolutely. Zenly supports any appointment-based service business — hair salons, dental clinics, tattoo studios, physiotherapy clinics, fitness trainers, cleaning services, and more. The platform adapts terminology and features per vertical via configuration, with no code changes needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="4" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 3 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 3 ? null : 3" :aria-expanded="open === 3">
            How does the daily reconciliation work?
            <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-item__a" x-show="open === 3" x-cloak x-transition>
            <p>At the end of each day, the manager clicks "Close Day." Zenly automatically calculates gross revenue, discounts, net revenue, and payment mode breakdowns (cash / card / online). The day is then locked — no further edits can be made to that day's records, keeping your financials clean and auditable.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item reveal" data-delay="5" :class="{ 'faq-item--open': open === 4 }">
          <button class="faq-item__q" @click="open = open === 4 ? null : 4" :aria-expanded="open === 4">
            What happens if a customer wants to reschedule?
